# compiled output
/dist
/node_modules
/build

# TypeScript incremental build cache. Once `rootDir` is pinned tsc writes it at
# the project root, NOT inside dist/, so nest-cli's `deleteOutDir` cannot clear
# it. A stale one plus a wiped dist/ makes tsc conclude there is nothing to
# emit: the build exits 0 and produces assets with no code.
# See docs/adr/0003-build-entrypoint-path-contract.md.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# OS
.DS_Store

# Tests
/coverage
/.nyc_output

